    "text_full": "By JOHN GRUBER\n\nARCHIVE\nTHE TALK SHOW\nDITHERING\nPROJECTS\nCONTACT\nCOLOPHON\nFEEDS / SOCIAL\nSPONSORSHIP\n\nOpenAI, Anthropic, Cursor, and Perplexity chose WorkOS over building it themselves.\n\nAbout This Site\n\nDaring Fireball is written and produced by John Gruber.\n\n\nPortrait by George Del Barrio\n\nESSENTIAL APPS\nBBEdit\nMarsEdit\nAcorn\nTransmit\nNetNewsWire\nScript Debugger\nNapkin\nYojimbo\nSERVER SOFTWARE\n\nThe Daring Fireball website is hosted by Linode. They’re great.\n\nArticles and links are, believe it or not, still published through Movable Type. She may not look like much, but I’ve made a lot of special modifications myself.\n\n \n\nDisplay Preferences\n\nCopyright © 2002–2026 The Daring Fireball Company LLC."
